<tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 0.25in"/><td style="text-align: left; width: 0.25in">&#9679;</td><td style="text-align: justify">You may not be able to enforce a judgment of a foreign court
in Taiwan</td>
</tr>
<tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td/><td style="text-align: left">&#9679;</td><td style="text-align: justify">Any further economic downturn or decline in the growth of
