diagnostic tests and therapeutic product candidates that are the same as or similar to ours but that are not covered by the claims of
the patents that we own or have exclusively licensed;</span></td>
</tr></table><div>
</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 48pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24pt">&#160;</p><div>

