with developing a submission strategy with the FDA, as well as drafting and reviewing all documents required by the FDA.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><b>&#160;</b></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>Timeline for Bringing Our Pancreatic and Breast Cancer Blood Test
Services and Products to Market</b></p><div>

