</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company does not currently rely on any single-source
suppliers for its raw materials. The Company has not entered into long-term contracts with the top suppliers. Instead, the Company enters
