</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>Strengthening Intellectual Property and Scientific
Leadership</b></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company has significantly strengthened its
global intellectual property position, creating a high-barrier IP moat. Breast cancer patents have been issued in 28 countries, and pancreatic
