$429,407 for the year ended December 31, 2025, compared to $ 355,004 for the year ended December 31, 2024. The cost of revenue consists
primarily of purchase costs of products for resales. The increase in cost of revenue was primarily due to the increase in revenue of 17%.
The increase in cost of revenue was higher than the increase of net revenue, which was primarily due to the change of sales mix to the
