</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company is also obligated to pay a royalty
of 10% of the sales of the products generated from 3D Global Patent to 3D Global on a quarterly basis, and patent application fees (if
any), patent maintenance fees, and project development fees. As of the date of this report, there have been no patent application fees,
