</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: -0.5pt">To the Shareholders and Board of Directors of</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 36.2pt 0pt 0; text-indent: -0.5pt">YD Bio Limited</p><div>

