<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Deferred offering costs represent legal,
accounting, underwriting, and other direct costs incurred in connection with a planned equity or debt offering. These costs are deferred
until the closing of the offering, at which time the deferred costs are offset against the offering proceeds. In the event the offering
is unsuccessful or aborted, the costs will be expensed.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

