<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Ordinary Shares &#8212; The Company
is authorized to issue <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c46" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-20437">500,000,000</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares with a par value of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c46" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-20438">0.0001</ix:nonFraction> per share. Holders of ordinary shares are entitled to
<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c42" name="us-gaap:CommonStockVotingRights" id="ixv-20439">one</ix:nonNumeric> vote per share owned on each matter properly submitted to the shareholders on which the holders of the ordinary shares are entitled
