<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0; text-align: justify">In December 2025, <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c162" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionEquityInterestsIssuedOrIssuableNumberOfSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-20445">62,580</ix:nonFraction> public warrants
