for <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c46" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-20448">205,333</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares on a cashless basis.</p>

